note Every schedule word is stored duplicated, the 32-bit value in both halves (d = (x << 32) | x), so
note a rotate right by r is the low half of d >> r and a plain shift right by n is d >> (32 + n); sums
note are formed in the low 32 bits (add, and, xor, or need no masks) and duplicated once on store.
